{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2022-04", "window": 1, "start_date": 1648771200, "end_date": 1651363199, "month_true_total": 6, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:53:36 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "114698804", "author": {"steamid": "76561199145719803", "personaname": "The Machine", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199145719803/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 430, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 219, "last_played": 1705634052, "avatar": "2e8088760dc96b3d1c4db271d2b5e19ec7fbeca5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game multiplayer is still active but you have to go to origin to install dlc", "timestamp_created": 1651292001, "timestamp_updated": 1651292001, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54456251859664917", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "114588089", "author": {"steamid": "76561198074027759", "personaname": "Nurse Paco", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198074027759/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 8012, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3834, "last_played": 1654906110, "avatar": "23e47fc2c40d8500d41f61dee0980262f81cc260"}, "language": "english", "review": "It has it's flaws, including its end, but the experience along the way is worth it. You can see where they expanded the set pieces of ME2 but they continue to be either linear in design or a bit repetitive. The gameplay is great for a cover shooter and the script (ending aside) holds up. If you are a fan of the series, the greedy practices of the past have been reduced in price which make the sticker price worth it during a sale.", "timestamp_created": 1651106327, "timestamp_updated": 1651348136, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "114120849", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043496089", "personaname": "๖ۣۜSαмÆL", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/khiratho/", "num_games_owned": 4232, "num_reviews": 121, "playtime_forever": 205, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 205, "last_played": 1650251175, "avatar": "f51563f935a194cdc726ee83b360f2afbb612621"}, "language": "english", "review": "Tip: If you already played it on EA/Origin, you can load your save-game and the achievements will jump like frogs.\n\nThe game is a bad ending to an epic saga, but until the final chapter, it's a good game.\nAs for that chapter... it's well known on the internet what happened with it so I won't expand on it.\n\nThis version with all the DLCs is worth it.", "timestamp_created": 1650368698, "timestamp_updated": 1650368698, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 39, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.729808509349822998", "comment_count": 7, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "114103220", "author": {"steamid": "76561199013630500", "personaname": "Lech", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199013630500/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 212, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 189, "last_played": 1650337489, "avatar": "f0b1796f3c2f4c05135dfb45a26a4c7da35a8815"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is the worst game ever made. An absolute slap in the face to every single choice you made in the first two games. It's not just the ending either, the whole game is.", "timestamp_created": 1650333996, "timestamp_updated": 1650334086, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.484535723924636841", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "113304570", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026128875", "personaname": "C0MMAND3R", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198026128875/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 3520, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 218, "last_played": 1713389971, "avatar": "7ef3a20305318557481cd78ac2afbfe3cd17047c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great Nostalgia vibe. Used to play a lot on my Wii U... Mostly multiplayer.\n\nGlad to see the online servers are still up. For the free multiplayer DLCs, you have to go to the extra content section under \"details\" on the origin platform.\n\nLegendary edition is an awesome alternative for the single-player dlcs", "timestamp_created": 1649025229, "timestamp_updated": 1649025229, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "113240554", "author": {"steamid": "76561198993820296", "personaname": "Impala", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198993820296/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 21207, "playtime_last_tw